{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/fce43a21d980a170b5b8241793ece68c.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Explore the Sea\" width=1200 height=140 /></span>Oh no! The world is flooded. But this is no time to give up hope. Build a ship and explore the remains! A variety of different islands await you. Some yield resources, some are home to unique characters. No timers, explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/1a6ed48f513606dfbf0aa94286860d36.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Build your Ship\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all kinds of resources and recycle them to build the ship of your dreams. Grow and farm your own plants on board and convert them into bio-fuel. Or will you build a ship that's powered by sunlight or wind? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/ad351124d5380cca511cc664f0a05263.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Find new Friends\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world inhibits several unique characters. Get to know them and help each other out! Share your skills and you might get something in return. Together you can build a wholesome community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8b0203ea69e6630251ffa2c22873123f.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" aria-label=\"Player being in a dialogue with a character\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8b0203ea69e6630251ffa2c22873123f.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8b0203ea69e6630251ffa2c22873123f.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/252874d1fb5988feb07b439f0e22369a.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Save Memories\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a photo camera, you can make travel memories. Catalogue birds, plants, characters or just take some snapshots of pretty vistas. They all get saved into your personal journal. In the end, it\u2019s your very own journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8750e734a17f03e3ff720d702abd968d.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" aria-label=\"Player taking a photo\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8750e734a17f03e3ff720d702abd968d.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8750e734a17f03e3ff720d702abd968d.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430280?t=1769805590","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/b3759259e2ec8e34ffa481fdbf6d382cb54fa2db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769805590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/e62e5e14008aa25e239bf9a714192f5f63b8d0a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769805590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/e62e5e14008aa25e239bf9a714192f5f63b8d0a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769805590","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join our community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/f1fb4ef4b2cbabfebf63fc91e2ec0be0.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/a18adc21b3e0b45846d386a704d7f998.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/fce43a21d980a170b5b8241793ece68c.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Explore the Sea\" width=1200 height=140 /></span>Oh no! The world is flooded. But this is no time to give up hope. Build a ship and explore the remains! A variety of different islands await you. Some yield resources, some are home to unique characters. No timers, explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/7b47f4b3b9b312beba42d576757c459f.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/1a6ed48f513606dfbf0aa94286860d36.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Build your Ship\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all kinds of resources and recycle them to build the ship of your dreams. Grow and farm your own plants on board and convert them into bio-fuel. Or will you build a ship that's powered by sunlight or wind? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/caeb836c3252df6679f84811012110b0.mp4?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/ad351124d5380cca511cc664f0a05263.avif?t=1769805590\" alt=\"Find new Friends\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world inhibits several unique characters. Get to know them and help each other out! Share your skills and you might get something in return. Together you can build a wholesome community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8b0203ea69e6630251ffa2c22873123f.poster.avif?t=1769805590\" aria-label=\"Player being in a dialogue with a character\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8b0203ea69e6630251ffa2c22873123f.webm?t=1769805590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati